OL,5,G1900 Traffic Cops: Elite Squad One
OL,6,     FNear Harrogate, cop Paddy chases a
OL,7,     Fdriver seen using his phone,
OL,8,     Fleading to a dangerous high-speed
OL,9,     Fpursuit. On the A1, cop Paul races
OL,10,     Fto intercept a suspected
OL,11,     Ffraudster. (Ep2/2)
OL,12,G2000 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
